idx|tags|instrument|complexity|description|sortby|comment
101|groupby:2|all|advanced|one-minute OHLCV bars for every symbol over the full trade table|sym,minute|By sym and minute = time floored to the minute (the bucket's start). open and close are the price of the bucket's first and last trade in table order (time, ties in load order); high and low the max and min price; volume the float64 sum of size (sizes can be fractional). Only buckets with trades appear.
102|groupby:1|all|simple|daily summary per symbol over all trades: VWAP, volume, trade count, high, low|sym|By sym over every trade. vwap = sum(price * size) / sum(size) and volume = sum(size), both in float64 from price and size widened first; trades = count; high and low = max and min price.
103|asofjoin|all|advanced|every trade with its prevailing quote by sym and time, plus the effective spread|time,idx|Every trade, no filter. The prevailing quote is the last quote of the same sym with quote time <= trade time; quotes tied on (sym, time) resolve to the last in table order. effSpread = 2 * abs(price - (bid + ask) / 2) in float64. A trade with no prevailing quote has null bid, ask and effSpread. Quotes are taken as they are, one-sided ones (bid or ask 0) included.
104|windowjoin|all|advanced|window join: every trade with the max bid and min ask of its symbol's quotes within one second either side|time,idx|Every trade, no filter. maxBid and minAsk are the max bid and min ask of the quotes of the same sym with trade time - 1s <= quote time <= trade time + 1s, both ends inclusive; only quotes inside the window count (q wj1, not wj: the quote prevailing at the window's start is not added). A trade with no quote in its window has null maxBid and minAsk.
105|refjoin,groupby:1|all|simple|total volume and trade count by securityType, from the master reference table joined on sym|securityType|Trades left-joined to master on sym, grouped by securityType: volume = float64 sum of size, trades = count. Trades whose sym has no master row form the null securityType group.
106|groupby:1|all|simple|odd-lot trades (size < 100) priced 10 to 100, counted by exchange|ex|Trades with size < 100 and 10 <= price <= 100, both ends inclusive, counted by ex. An exchange with none does not appear.
107|topn|all|advanced|the 10 largest trades of every symbol by size|sym,sizeRank|Within each sym, trades ranked by size descending, ties by time ascending and then table order; sizeRank counts from 1 and the rows with sizeRank <= 10 are kept (fewer when the sym has fewer trades).
108|groupby:1|all|simple|distinct symbols quoted on each exchange|ex|Over the whole quote table, symCount = the number of distinct syms per ex.
109|groupby:2|all|advanced|one-minute log returns per symbol and their realised volatility|sym|Per sym, close = the last price in table order of every minute bucket (time floored to the minute) that has a trade; ret = ln(close / the previous such bucket's close), in float64; a gap of empty minutes is not filled and the first bucket has no return. Per sym with at least one return: nret = the number of returns, rvol = 10000 * their population standard deviation (q dev, divisor n), in basis points per bar.
